step Expert Enchanting
  tip Disenchant the green armour you made for Tailoring 150-225: 22 Azure Silk Cloaks (item level 35, from Enchanting 75), 36 Black Mageweave Vests (item level 41, from Enchanting 125) and 37 Black Mageweave Headbands (item level 46, from Enchanting 150) give about 95 Vision Dust, 58 Soul Dust, 42 Dream Dust, 11 Greater Nether Essence, 11 Lesser Nether Essence, 7 Lesser Mystic Essence, 2 Large Radiant Shard, 2 Small Radiant Shard and 1 Small Glowing Shard. Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Enchanting 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Kitta Firewind (Elwynn Forest); Horde Hgarth (Stonetalon Mountains). This route trains it at Kitta Firewind (Elwynn Forest) for the Alliance and Hgarth (Stonetalon Mountains) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 150-225: one trainer for every visit. Learn now: Runed Golden Rod (from 150). 150-225 takes 1 Iridescent Pearl, 1 Black Pearl, 1 Greater Astral Essence, 55 Soul Dust, 1 Golden Rod, 10 Lesser Mystic Essence, 1 Greater Mystic Essence, 21 Vision Dust and 1 Truesilver Rod to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility (from 160), Enchant Chest - Greater Intellect (from 185), Runed Truesilver Rod (from 200) and Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (from 205), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 4.
